WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.399
- I'm glowing, I might
not be Asian glowing,

00:00:01.399 --> 00:00:04.983
but I'm glowing, from the inside out.

00:00:04.983 --> 00:00:06.239
- I'm glowing from the outside.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.822
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.384 --> 00:00:11.300
- Hi, my name is Elton Keung

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.741
former owner of Boba 7,
aspiring owner of Labobatory.

00:00:14.741 --> 00:00:16.636
And people are gonna try my alcoholic boba

00:00:16.636 --> 00:00:18.153
for the first time today.

00:00:18.153 --> 00:00:19.726
- I've always wanted
to try alcoholic boba.

00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:23.413
- It sounds delicious, I think
it's going to be so great.

00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:24.964
- I think this will be
a beautiful union.

00:00:24.964 --> 00:00:26.059
- Same.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.582
- [Elton] First drink they'll be trying

00:00:27.582 --> 00:00:29.337
is the Green Tea Heineken
with Honey Green Tea,

00:00:29.337 --> 00:00:31.542
Heineken and honey boba on the bottom.

00:00:31.542 --> 00:00:32.555
- This looks delectable.

00:00:32.555 --> 00:00:33.676
- This is fun already.

00:00:33.676 --> 00:00:35.821
- Oh my God
- Ooooh!

00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:36.654
- This is so good,

00:00:36.654 --> 00:00:38.238
- Oooh, I love it.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.438
- It just smells like beer to me.

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:40.682
- I always fall asleep when I drink,

00:00:40.682 --> 00:00:42.422
so having green tea and caffeine,

00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:44.283
I feel like it's a great idea.

00:00:44.283 --> 00:00:46.105
- You actually don't taste
the beer after a while.

00:00:46.105 --> 00:00:47.536
- That's like how tailgating is.

00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:48.479
- There's always a weird
part where you're like,

00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:49.344
sucking it up and then
get one (chocking sound)

00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:50.177
(laughing)

00:00:50.177 --> 00:00:51.278
No you don't.

00:00:51.278 --> 00:00:52.111
Oh!

00:00:52.111 --> 00:00:52.944
(laughing)

00:00:52.944 --> 00:00:54.930
- [Elton] Second drink
is the Taro with Mezcal,

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.333
Mezcal is a smokey tequila.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:57.702
- Oh wow.

00:00:57.702 --> 00:00:59.498
- Ooh you can taste--

00:00:59.498 --> 00:01:00.331
- Oh my God!

00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:01.164
- The alcohol--

00:01:01.164 --> 00:01:01.997
- It's so good!

00:01:01.997 --> 00:01:03.238
- This innocent looking lilac, I was like,

00:01:03.238 --> 00:01:04.728
that thing's gonna be a breeze,

00:01:04.728 --> 00:01:05.816
and then I took that first sip,

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:07.060
and I was like no, there's
like a lot of alcohol

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:08.502
in there.

00:01:08.502 --> 00:01:10.349
- This is like an X-rated milkshake.

00:01:10.349 --> 00:01:12.152
- All of a sudden the alcohol just hit me.

00:01:12.152 --> 00:01:14.343
- I already am like,
feeling it, I'm like wow

00:01:14.343 --> 00:01:15.176
- I know!

00:01:15.176 --> 00:01:16.009
- I'm happy!

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:17.884
- I'm like it's hot in here.

00:01:17.884 --> 00:01:19.387
- If I need to describe
this as a pop star,

00:01:19.387 --> 00:01:20.637
it's a Rihanna.

00:01:21.474 --> 00:01:24.119
- [Elton] The Bobagasm,
which is a White Russian

00:01:24.119 --> 00:01:25.238
with boba.

00:01:25.238 --> 00:01:27.327
- Oh, oh (beep)

00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:28.160
- Wow.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:29.792
- Oooh, hummm.

00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:31.420
- Asian butter beer is
the thing I didn't know

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:32.893
was missing from my life.

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:35.932
- Oh, so the boba has alcohol in it.

00:01:35.932 --> 00:01:37.769
There is a God, and she loves us.

00:01:37.769 --> 00:01:38.790
- This is my favorite one.

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.549
- It's like, the drink
that you wanna just curl up

00:01:41.549 --> 00:01:44.757
on the, you know couch,
watch TV, watch some Netflix.

00:01:44.757 --> 00:01:46.180
- I love how creamy it is, I don't think

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.930
I can drink regular boba anymore.

00:01:49.964 --> 00:01:51.993
- That was like a spiritual
journey that I won't forget.

00:01:51.993 --> 00:01:53.133
- That was amazing.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.746
- That was a revolution for my mouth.

00:01:54.746 --> 00:01:56.978
- Thank you guys for making these drinks.

00:01:56.978 --> 00:01:57.811
- Come because--

00:01:57.811 --> 00:01:59.080
(laughing)

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.868
a hug, thank you so much.

00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:03.825
- To boba and alcohol.

00:02:03.825 --> 00:02:06.658
(glass clinking)

